.TH TWODRIVE-TRAY 1 "October 2026" "TwoDrive" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
twodrive-tray \- show TwoDrive status in the desktop panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B twodrive-tray
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows synchronization and transfer status, with controls to open the folder
and settings. Requires a graphical session with AppIndicator support.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR twodrive (1),
.BR twodrive-settings (1)
